{"id":11013,"date":"2022-11-08T12:59:16","date_gmt":"2022-11-08T12:59:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=11013"},"modified":"2022-11-09T11:47:49","modified_gmt":"2022-11-09T11:47:49","slug":"s-snom-sonata-v-d-moll","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/s-snom-sonata-v-d-moll\/","title":{"rendered":"s-SNOM son\u00e1ta v d moll"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Hudba je jedin\u00fdm opravdov\u011b univerz\u00e1ln\u00edm lidsk\u00fdm jazykem. \u017dije sama o sob\u011b a ka\u017ed\u00fd n\u00e1stroj, kter\u00fd vyluzuje t\u00f3n, je ve sv\u00e9 podstat\u011b samostatnou bytost\u00ed. Jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejv\u00fdznamn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch rod\u016f hudebn\u00edch n\u00e1stroj\u016f je slavn\u00e1 rodina <strong>Stradivari<\/strong>. Je zn\u00e1mo, \u017ee ka\u017ed\u00fd krok v\u00fdroby a ka\u017ed\u00fd pou\u017eit\u00fd materi\u00e1l m\u016f\u017ee ovlivnit v\u00fdslednou podobu n\u00e1stroje a jeho zvuk. Ty nejstar\u0161\u00ed legend\u00e1rn\u00ed kousky ov\u0161em z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed \u010dasto op\u0159eden\u00e9 tajemstv\u00edm.<\/p>\n<p>S\u00a0modern\u00edmi v\u011bdeck\u00fdmi metodami se v\u0161ak da\u0159\u00ed odhalovat r\u016fzn\u00e9 v\u00fdrobn\u00ed postupy, kter\u00e9 z\u016fst\u00e1valy mnoho let zapomenut\u00e9. <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/pubs.acs.org\/doi\/10.1021\/acs.analchem.2c02965\">Pomoc\u00ed metody SNOM se poda\u0159ilo analyzovat mikroskopick\u00e9 vzorky<\/a><\/strong>, a z\u00edskat tak p\u0159edstavu o chemick\u00e9m slo\u017een\u00ed jednotliv\u00fdch vrstev n\u00e1stroje. Kone\u010dn\u011b se tak poda\u0159ilo zodpov\u011bd\u011bt ot\u00e1zky t\u00fdkaj\u00edc\u00ed se pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed l\u00e1tek na b\u00e1zi protein\u016f, kter\u00e9 se p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b housl\u00ed Stradivari v\u00a0minulosti pou\u017e\u00edvaly.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00a0minulosti byly strunn\u00e9 n\u00e1stroje z\u00a0d\u00edlny Stradivari \u010dasto p\u0159edm\u011btem b\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed, ale jednotliv\u00e9 studie doch\u00e1zely ob\u010das k\u00a0rozporupln\u00fdm \u010di nep\u0159esn\u00fdm v\u00fdsledk\u016fm, a\u0165 u\u017e z\u00a0d\u016fvodu nutnosti odebrat jen mikroskopick\u00fd vzorek, nebo dal\u0161\u00edm limit\u016fm pou\u017eit\u00e9 metody.<\/p>\n<figure style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" id=\"gr2\" class=\"inline-fig internalNav\" src=\"https:\/\/pubs.acs.org\/cms\/10.1021\/acs.analchem.2c02965\/asset\/images\/medium\/ac2c02965_0002.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"363\" data-lg-src=\"\/cms\/10.1021\/acs.analchem.2c02965\/asset\/images\/large\/ac2c02965_0002.jpeg\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0158ez povrchovou vrstvou housl\u00ed Stradivari<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Metodou s-SNOM byly spolehliv\u011b detekov\u00e1ny i stopy protein\u016f &#8211; slo\u017eek l\u00e1tek, kter\u00fdmi byl povrch n\u00e1stroje o\u0161et\u0159en: ve spektrech jsou z\u0159eteln\u011b vid\u011bt p\u00e1sy amidu I a II. Podobn\u011b byly identifikov\u00e1ny i dal\u0161\u00ed l\u00e1tky jako jednotliv\u00e9 slo\u017eky laku a dal\u0161\u00edch vrstev. Z v\u00fdsledk\u016f m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed je vid\u011bt, \u017ee metoda s-SNOM je cenn\u00fdm n\u00e1strojem, kter\u00fd n\u00e1m nejen\u017ee umo\u017e\u0148uje vyv\u00edjet materi\u00e1ly budoucnosti, ale tak\u00e9 odhalit tajemstv\u00ed minulosti a jej\u00edch geni\u00e1ln\u00edch mistr\u016f. <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/11\/c2cda7a5.pdf\"><strong>Detaily studie si m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159e\u010d\u00edst zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"fv-img aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/pubs.acs.org\/cms\/10.1021\/acs.analchem.2c02965\/asset\/images\/medium\/ac2c02965_0003.gif\" alt=\"Figure 1\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hudba je jedin\u00fdm opravdov\u011b univerz\u00e1ln\u00edm lidsk\u00fdm jazykem. \u017dije sama o sob\u011b a ka\u017ed\u00fd n\u00e1st